# Specification: governance-reconciliation

Authorized local governance corrections; product acceptance stays in product-bootstrap.

- REQ-01: Profile, catalog, installed skills and bridges agree and reject unauthorized additions.
- AC-01 → REQ-01: Profile, catalog, installed skills and bridges agree and reject unauthorized additions.
- REQ-02: Historical recovery and current succession reject corruption, deletion and unreviewed edits.
- AC-02 → REQ-02: Historical recovery and current succession reject corruption, deletion and unreviewed edits.
- REQ-03: Fast and integration groups retain complete coverage with measured timings.
- AC-03 → REQ-03: Fast and integration groups retain complete coverage with measured timings.
- REQ-04: Clean packages exclude nested Git directories/worktree files and preserve governance validation.
- AC-04 → REQ-04: Clean packages exclude nested Git directories/worktree files and preserve governance validation.
